erred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 7,800 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $299,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["TYL.q.employees","TYL.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $1 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $81.8 million in short-term investments, and $0 of debt as tagged (ConvertibleDebtNoncurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $1.1 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["TYL.cash.2025","TYL.sti.2025","TYL.debtLong.2025"]}]},"fin":{"TYL":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":34,"read":34,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["MOORE H LYNN JR","President and CEO, director"],["Puckett Jeffrey David","Chief Operating Officer"],["Pope Daniel M","Director"],["Carter Glenn A","Director"],["Teed Andrew D.","Director"],["Diaz-Pedrosa Abigail Marshall","Chief Administrative Officer"],["MILLER BRIAN K","Executive VP and CFO"]],"rows":[["S",0,30000,12822048.36,"2026-11-13","2026-11-16","0002130035-26-000009","2026-11-17",0],["S",1,10000,4196925,"2026-11-04","2026-11-04","0002130035-26-000008","2026-11-06",0],["S",2,680,277140.8,"2026-11-02","2026-11-02","0002130035-26-000007","2026-11-04",0],["S",0,10000,3931689.11,"2026-10-30","2026-10-30","0002130035-26-000006","2026-11-03",0],["S",0,9250,3448279.75,"2026-08-28","2026-08-28","0002130035-26-000003","2026-09-01",0],["S",1,8500,3029697.5,"2026-08-24","2026-08-24","0002130035-26-000002","2026-08-26",0],["S",3,1624,567003.36,"2026-03-12","2026-03-12","0001240085-26-000011","2026-03-16",0],["S",1,5174,1914015.03,"2026-03-05","2026-03-05","0001240085-26-000010","2026-03-09",0],["S",2,500,177699.5,"2026-03-02","2026-03-02","0001240085-26-000009","2026-03-04",0],["P",4,1600,495856,"2026-02-23","2026-02-23","0001240085-26-000003","2026-02-25",0],["P",5,610,198296.36,"202